<div data-v-039ffd48="" role="text" class="data-content"><p data-v-039ffd48="" class="para">More than 300 channels for every taste, TV series, a huge library of films, cartoons.<br><br>Watch on your smartphone, tablet and Smart TV. <br>Pause the program, rewind, watch in the archive and take with you.<br><br>WINK is an opportunity to watch your favorite TV channels, films and series live in one application without advertising in digital and HD quality. <br><br>Watch all the most interesting things on any screen, whenever it is convenient for you.<br><br>You will not miss your favorite movie or program and will have a good time watching your favorite TV channels not only at home on the TV screen, but also in transport, on a trip, in nature, while waiting in line.<br><br>WINK:<br>• Excellent image and sound quality<br>• Convenient program guide<br>• Viewing control: pause, rewind, archive of programs<br>• Viewing on a smartphone, tablet, Smart TV<br>• Simple and easy to install.<br><br>ONE ACCOUNT FOR ALL DEVICES<br>• All screens are united by one account. You can pause on one device and continue watching from the same place on another<br>• Purchase movies and TV series forever or by monthly subscription with access from all devices at no extra cost.<br><br>MORE THAN 300 TV CHANNELS: <br>Live: sports, children's, news, educational, historical, entertainment, religious, about fishing and cars.<br><br>THOUSANDS OF FILMS AND TV SERIES<br>The video library is constantly updated. There is always something to watch:<br>• Oscar nominees, the best Hollywood films<br>• Russian films and TV series<br>• cartoons for children and adults<br>• films from the world's leading studios: Disney, Buena Vista, Sony Pictures (Columbia Pictures, TriStar Pictures), Universal, Warner Bros., Paramount, Twentieth Century Fox, Marvel, Metro Goldwyn Mayer (MGM)<br>• video subscription from Amediа.<br><br>You can choose the latest releases and everyone's favorite films in the video catalog from thousands of video units in SD and Full HD.</p></div>